    "passiveSpell": "SonaPassive",
    "passiveToolTip": "<passive>Accelerando</passive>: Sona gains Accelerando stacks from using her Basic Abilities well. She gains +%i:scaleAH% @AccelerandoAHPerStack@ Basic Ability Haste permanently per stack, up to %i:scaleAH% @AccelerandoCap@ Basic Ability Haste. When she reaches %i:scaleAH% @AccelerandoCap@ Basic Ability Haste, instead of gaining further stacks her current <keywordMajor>Ultimate Ability's</keywordMajor> cooldown is reduced by @Spell.SonaPassive:AccelerandoUltCDR@ seconds.<br><br><passive>Power Chord</passive>: After using @PowerChordPassiveCountMax@ basic Abilities, Sona's next Attack deals an additional <magicDamage>@PowerChordDamage@ magic damage</magicDamage> and may have an additional effect based on the song Sona last activated.<br><li><spellName>Hymn of Valor:</spellName> The Attack deals <magicDamage>@Spell.SonaQ:TotalStaccatoDamage@ magic damage</magicDamage> instead.<li><spellName>Aria of Perseverance:</spellName> The target deals @Spell.SonaW:TotalDiminuendoWeakenPercent@ less damage for @Spell.SonaW:DiminuendoDuration@ seconds.<li><spellName>Song of Celerity:</spellName> The target is <status>Slowed</status> by @Spell.SonaE:TotalTempoMoveSpeedSlow@ for @Spell.SonaE:TempoDuration@ seconds.",
